{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n「CHIIKAWA SHOP in HONG KONG」二樓店將於11月27日起正式換上全新「Chiikawa Clinic」可愛診所主題！店內以治癒系診所為設計靈感，牆身、地面及貨架均佈滿主題插畫與隱藏打卡位，立體醫護造型的吉伊卡哇、小八及兔兔更首度可愛登場，讓大家盡情打卡留念。店內同時與日本同步發售逾百款全新系列及官方授權商品，包括診所造型角色精品、迷你收納盒盲盒及多款實用小物。店舖初期將經 Klook 網站分階段開放預約，第二輪入場名額將於12月1日上午10時起開放預約，適用於12月4日至12月10日入場粉絲們記得準時搶位！\n</p>\n<p>「CHIIKAWA SHOP in HONG KONG」二樓店 — Chiikawa Clinic 主題詳情<br/>\n地點：旺角 MOKO 新世紀廣場 2 樓 236 號舖</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588161737731428_7951166066b0afa91d5b58.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588161737731428_7951166066b0afa91d5b58.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588162036518805_2290154226b0afa9522331.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588162036518805_2290154226b0afa9522331.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588162246161784_4705531256b0afa96d19bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588162246161784_4705531256b0afa96d19bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588162418439479_9353391826b0afa994d16b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588162418439479_9353391826b0afa994d16b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588162730327604_14603251016b0afa9ba6fd3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588162730327604_14603251016b0afa9ba6fd3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588162937925533_10090449926b0afa9de3a6c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588162937925533_10090449926b0afa9de3a6c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588163097358929_18510883886b0afa9f6aaed.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179588163097358929_18510883886b0afa9f6aaed.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgSa2UuiHaB/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T16:21:30.828296+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":494,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T16:00:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:35:10.935686+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:56.485583+00:00","content_hash":"607bcd0849acdb043c56327d32e9edad633b4bd2e0c19861b9cdf75458431bed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_rete